usage: session.py [-h] --work WORK --model MODEL {build,run,status}

Bounded C6 preparation/measurement pipeline. No provisioning or remote calls.
The caller must select exactly one GPU. A work directory has one fixed
deadline. Each build retry has a new attempt. A run never trusts an earlier
correctness gate.

positional arguments:
  {build,run,status}

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --work WORK
  --model MODEL
